course: dictionary
lesson: 3543
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning, and the context tells you which one the writer means. The word feed is a good example. Look at the words around it and ask: what is happening here?
explain: «Feed the cat» means give food to a pet. «Cows feed on grass» means the cows are eating. «Feed paper into the printer» means push paper into a machine. The same word does three different jobs.
explain: Check your meaning by putting it back into the sentence. In «Huge numbers of animals swim up at night to feed near the surface», feed means eat, because the animals are looking for food. If your meaning makes no sense, try another one.
fact: Feed can be a verb (a doing word) or a noun (a naming word).
fact: As a verb, «feed» means to give food to a person or animal, or for an animal to eat.
fact: «Feed on» means an animal eats something: the owl feeds on mice.
fact: «Fed up» means bored or annoyed.
fact: Online, a feed is a list of new posts on a website or app, and not every post is true.
exercise: «Please feed the cat before school.» What does feed mean here? | Clean the cat's bowl | *Give food to an animal | Lock the door | Stroke the cat gently
exercise: «Cows feed on grass in the field.» What does feed on mean? | To bark | To sell | *To eat | To fall asleep
exercise: Mia says a feed is a list of new posts on her app. What is a feed in this sense? | A meal eaten at a picnic | *A list of new posts on a website or app | A bowl of food for a dog | A kind of computer
test: «Ravi was fed up with waiting in the queue.» What does fed up mean? | Happy and excited | Very hungry | *Bored or annoyed | Full of food
test: «Feed the paper into the printer slowly.» What does feed mean? | Read aloud | Cut into small pieces | Give food to a bird | *Push something into a machine
exam: Which sentence uses feed as a noun meaning food for animals? | Cows feed on grass. | *Buy a bag of chicken feed from the shop. | Please feed the printer. | Dad will feed the dog at six.
